Subdomain CourseCatalog of TeachingAndLearning
    documentation 'A Course entity represents the definition of the course, its
                  'characteristics, and its mapping to LearningStandards or
                  'LearningObjectives. A course may be defined a state, LEA or school
                  'level. The CourseOffering entity represents a course that is offered
                  'by a school during a session. The CourseOffering will have a
                  'LocalCourseCode and may have a LocalCourseTitle.
    domain item Course
    domain item CourseOffering
    domain item EducationOrganization
    domain item LearningObjective
    domain item LearningStandard
    domain item School
    domain item Session
